  "content": {
    "_uid": "0422d0c6-0749-fcb5-5972-040fb4c8cce2",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "10bc51d9-9d1a-5ede-1fb5-057ccfe0b7ac",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Judges included Mr. Jamil Yousuf, Chief of the CPLC, Mr. Sultan Masood, Zonal Head of State Life Insurance Corp. of Pakistan, and AKU faculty: Dr. Abul Faizi, Chairman, Department of Psychiatry and Dr. Fauzia Shamim from AKU Institute for Educational Development.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The first prize for Urdu was awarded to Nasir Sohail of the Sir Syed University of Engineering and Technology and the second prize was received by Uzma Ghani of the Bahria Institute of Management and Computer Sciences. First and second prizes in the English-speaking contest were awarded to Pamela Yousuf of the St. Joseph's Govt. College for Women and Gohar Karim of the University of Karachi, respectively. The Team Trophy was awarded to St. Joseph's Govt. College for Women and the runner-up to the University of Karachi.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
