    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University organized its second Bilingual Public Speaking Competition on February 21, 2001. This much-awaited competition brings together institutions of higher learning in an attempt to promote the art of public speaking among the youth. Teams from nineteen institutions in Karachi, with speakers in English and Urdu competed for the trophy. The AKU team participated in the competition as hosts and did not compete for the trophy.",
